+
+## Public login kill switch (#109)
+
+Close **all** sign-in (demo + provisioned) until you reopen:
+
+| Where | Variable | Closed | Open |
+|-------|----------|--------|------|
+| Vercel (frontend) | `LOGIN_ENABLED` | `false` | `true` or unset |
+| Render (API) | `LOGIN_ENABLED` | `false` | `true` or unset |
+
+After changing Vercel env, redeploy the frontend. Render picks up env on restart/redeploy.
+
+```bash
+# Closed: login page shows EN/AR closed state; POST /api/v1/auth/login → 403
+# Open: set LOGIN_ENABLED=true (or remove) on both hosts
+```
